        "original_id": "12eacbe7-2792-5ffd-9da0-1a9d50f23323",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Radomski, Bruce Timm\n- TV series: Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., Guardians of the Galaxy\n- Films: The Avengers, Batman: Mask of the Phantasm\n- Networks: Disney XD\n- Concepts: successors, cinematic continuations\n\nFacts:\n- The 2012 film The Avengers inspired the creation of Avengers Assemble.\n- Avengers Assemble premiered on Disney XD on May 26, 2013.\n- Avengers Assemble was developed as the successor to an earlier series.\n- Eric Radomski was associated with Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., and Guardians of the Galaxy.\n- Batman: Mask of the Phantasm was directed by Eric Radomski and Bruce Timm.\n- Batman: Mask of the Phantasm is a cinematic continuation of an earlier work.",
